cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this toolkit, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Secure AI Foundations: An Open Toolkit for Connecting AI to Customer-Data Platforms Securely"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-08
repository-code: "https://github.com/mahmoudalide/secure-ai-foundations"
abstract: >-
  Secure AI Foundations (SAF) is an open toolkit for organizations that run
  critical customer-data platforms, starting with small and mid-size U.S.
  communications providers. It contains an AI-workload security control
  baseline, an AI governance template mapped to the NIST AI Risk Management
  Framework 1.0, an AI-readiness checklist for CRM and customer-data
  platforms, and OLIR-style mappings to NIST CSF 2.0, SP 800-53 Rev. 5 and
  AI RMF 1.0. Version 0.1.0 is a draft for feedback.
